R3 execution brief for 달팽이 우체부. Approved plan: /Users/seul/Desktop/dotgame-yongdam/.gjc/_session-01a1c41b-d1bb-765e-8fc6-4534210c5554/plans/ralplan/r3-plan/pending-approval.md (sha256 45c02cde...). Sole spec: GAME_DESIGN.md v5 (human-signed, commit 09e52f4) + AGENTS.md. Constraints: implement only what GAME_DESIGN.md v5 says; no Space+arrow move, no snail direction display, no mute/volume/pause UI, no BGM, no audio files, no webfont, no levels beyond 3; do not edit AGENTS.md or GAME_DESIGN.md numbers; pure src/logic.js (no canvas/audio/localStorage); levels copied from ch.5 grids; sprites/glyphs as palette-index arrays; UI text only in src/strings.js; commit prefix goal-N:. Completion = human checks the R3 items in a browser (python3 -m http.server 8000); test pass or fixture screenshots are not evidence. Stop after goal-4 for the human check before goal-5.

@goal: goal-4 levels 2 and 3, three-level flow (R3-1..R3-9)
Implement per GAME_DESIGN.md v5 ch.2.2/3/5/9: LEVELS array in src/levels.js (level 1 30s, level 2 45s, level 3 60s, grids copied from ch.5), levelIndex in state, LEVEL_COUNT=3; clear (level 1,2) screen shows 배달 완료 + Enter로 시작 (no score line in goal-4), Enter on clear advances to next level (fresh state, clock starts, same-frame direction discarded), R and directions ignored on clear; fail R restarts the failed level (no return to level 1); play R restarts current level only; temporary goal-4 state: level 3 clear shows plain 배달 완료 line only, Enter ignored, R restarts level 1. Transition functions return the same object when not applicable. main.js computes level once per frame from state.levelIndex. Tests: solution replay for levels 1,2,3 (keys in ch.5; expected remaining ms 22300/24700/33100), per-level letter count/start/time limit, clear->next level, same-object identity tests, intermediate clear R ignored; update existing tests that assume level 1 only. Human check items: R3-1..R3-9.

@goal: goal-5 sound, score, best score, final screen (R3-10..R3-21)
Implement per GAME_DESIGN.md v5 ch.2.2/3/7/8/9: score = 100 x letters + 10 x timerDisplay at the clear frame; pure soundsOf(prev,next) in logic (no events field; deliver+clear/final -> clear/final only); src/audio.js Web Audio synthesis with injectable AudioContext, unlock synchronously in keydown, no audio files; src/storage.js single key snailPostman.bestScore with injectable storage, getter exceptions caught, save once on final transition, hide 최고 line on failure, no fake fallback; final screen (배달 완료 / 점수 N / 최고 B, no Enter hint, Enter ignored, R new run score 0); title shows 최고 N only when stored; new Hangul glyphs 점 수 최 고 12x12 palette 7 only; strings only in src/strings.js. Tests per plan section 10. Human check items: R3-10..R3-21.
